      "en": "Benaiah the son of Jehoiada was over the army; Zadok and Abiathar were priests;",
      "ko": "여호야다의 아들 브나야는 군대장관이요 사독과 아비아달은 제사장이요",
      "source_text_hash": "cf51d4c14af44224cfc8e7c136f2cd720039b3a95cbb594e0eeceee7fca68fc3",
      "translation_text_hash": "88698d357091b7ea8a6a77ac913d8f1843dde97338c2fbc1bbb88c3f8cedc34b",
