      "en": "Ahishar was over the household; and Adoniram the son of Abda was over the men subject to forced labor.",
      "ko": "아히살은 궁내대신이요 압다의 아들 아도니람은 감역관이더라",
      "source_text_hash": "768958de24256f402e6b423a7f07b7322e0818157daceaad0b128ec448eb25ab",
      "translation_text_hash": "c88c9d04b7238d6d71958968c9327699a035445aeec2e117e9f35c94748458e2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "아히살은 궁내대신이요 압다의 아들 아도니람은 감역관이더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "c88c9d04b7238d6d71958968c9327699a035445aeec2e117e9f35c94748458e2"
      ]
