      "en": "Ben Abinadab, in all the height of Dor (he had Taphath, Solomon’s daughter, as wife);",
      "ko": "돌 높은 땅 온 지방에는 벤아비나답이니 저는 솔로몬의 딸 다밧으로 아내를 삼았으며",
      "source_text_hash": "1529bde54c68bbc384362ebb5afb0a89fedf1e2078b47b905d0712288ab69133",
      "translation_text_hash": "9d7d12537859af91bf58833d68100a6f4aa01cf85fca71c50e28e2c988a2fed3",
