      "en": "Judah and Israel were numerous as the sand which is by the sea in multitude, eating and drinking and making merry.",
      "ko": "유다와 이스라엘의 인구가 바닷가의 모래 같이 많게 되매 먹고 마시며 즐거워하였으며",
      "source_text_hash": "815ed37b3f72f7d8abf42c58e8021c57e1fe9f821ad3c1639a6809bc5666a8ef",
      "translation_text_hash": "154ee02c35b813a1142b39ad2fd638af88f4706c97543681329fc99162fc9cf9",
