      "en": "Solomon’s provision for one day was thirty cors of fine flour, sixty measures of meal,",
      "ko": "솔로몬의 일일분 식물은 가는 밀가루가 삼십석이요 굵은 밀가루가 육십석이요",
      "source_text_hash": "0907eba0214e31a845e65e61ce70a9a9fa58902132d89682b92be55ba3a0b607",
